---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import ProductCard from './ProductCard.astro';
---
<section class="showcase section-pad" id="card"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">The card</p><h2>Your business card,<br /><em>reimagined.</em></h2><p>Share everything that matters with one simple tap. No paper. No complicated setup. Just a smarter way to connect.</p></div><div class="showcase-visual reveal-product"><div class="card-pair"><ProductCard class="product-card-large card-front" side="front" /><ProductCard class="product-card-large card-back" side="back" /></div></div><div class="feature-list"><div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><Icon name="radio" size={18} /></div><div><p class="feature-number">01</p><h3>Tap to share</h3><p>Share your digital profile instantly using NFC technology.</p></div><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></div><div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><Icon name="user" size={18} /></div><div><p class="feature-number">02</p><h3>Your digital profile</h3><p>Keep your contact information, social media, and important links together in one place.</p></div><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></div><div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><Icon name="refresh" size={18} /></div><div><p class="feature-number">03</p><h3>Always up to date</h3><p>Update your information anytime without replacing your physical card.</p></div><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></div></div></section>
